# ref-into-split multi
library "Multi".

// Multi-layer: a terminology (Concepts) AND a coded-from concept (Asserted).
// emit auto-splits this into "Multi Concepts" + "Multi Asserted".
terminology "Multi Vs":
- valueset is `multi-vs`.

concept "Leaf Concept":
- type is Observation.
- value type is CodeableConcept.
- coded from "Multi Vs".
